w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fSTl24xARWAQ7kNvwFCEmN5&_nc_oc=AdmmibrntKXhRKdcqtupjFrYzmUGXsinmilK_vNpLsyskaVMWiSb1gRL-4aIHiqDIRs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyJYByp80aUNyKf-FyId8Sig8lqUplvCCDHOzEtwpVcqw&oe=69B941AA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t-aWc4-1ZkAQ7kNvwFbjaIX&_nc_oc=Adnicf9KEEnlYYGYYqPJUdlvKOYcw1Ly0cqk2uk1pES0BjQyc25XIz81oUKxGxoqScM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzGnDq3SJnVAuOsLuBKf6TlrLElwgTL9z182-_dAUIoLg&oe=69B9545E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SZFgThz6HAMQ7kNvwEL3LpL&_nc_oc=AdkAb-RykfOYrbZZJqcVr6eFo5PEfdNsb6Pal-0uKTvqDxACvGrvWVHY7WQII6Uqti0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxGMdWKJ6DZHt84S2qWmsicSwD2aiGnrlRZLLIMrBVzUg&oe=69B94331"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9